The Go guideline dataset under internal/guidelines/data/go.json is derived
from the JetBrains/go-modern-guidelines guideline data via a one-shot,
commit-locked ingestion snapshot (see scripts/ingest-jetbrains-go). It is a
forked snapshot, not a vendored copy, and is re-ingested and diff-reviewed
only when the upstream project ships a new minor release.
